	  <br>


          Greetings Fellow Norrathians of Luclin!<br>
            I am Quella Junipurr, member of the Chief Council of the Wildfyre Legion, and I would like to announce that our guild is holding a server-wide lotto on Friday, October 27, 2000! We will have guild members in each of the following zones selling tickets between 8-9pm EST:<br>
          1)East Commons (tunnel)<br>
          2)Greater Faydark<br>
          3)Qeynos Hills/ North Qeynos<br>
          4)North/ South Karana<br>
          5)Lake of Ill Omen<br>
          6) Highpass/ Highkeep<br>
          7)West Commons<br>
          8)Butcherblock<br>
          ***Ticket Prices:<br>
          MAX OF 5 TICKETS TO A PERSON!<br>
          Level Range and Cost<br>
          1-9, 1pp<br>
          10-19, 3pp<br>
          20-29, 5pp<br>
          30-39, 10pp<br>
          40-49, 20pp<br>
          50+, 30pp<br>
          ***This is how we will be doing the lotto:<br>
            When a person asks for a ticket, the WF member will take the money from them and write down their name, and how many tickets they bought. Then they will give the player their ticket <br>
          number(s). The ticket number is X000 + Y (where X is your zone number as stated above and Y is the number of tickets you sold)<br>
          ex: In North/South Karana, the WF member sells their first ticket. The player gets ticket 4001 (4000 + 1). After that would be 4002-4999.<br>
          <br>
          ***Twinks: If we know someone is twinked, we will ask them to please pay as if they were playing as their highest level character.<br>
          <br>
          After 1 hour of selling, we will all take 30 or so minutes to all meet in East Commons, where we will pool the money and put all of the tickets into a numeric order.<br>
          <br>
          3 drawings will be done via "/random ticket1 ticketmax" The drawings will take place between 9:30 and 10pmEST.<br>
          <br>
          ***1st place take 70%, 2nd place takes 20%, 3rd place takes 10% . . . we will also hold some for future events (if the pot exceeds 1000pp).<br>
            We have held 2 previous lottos, which took place only in East Commons, and though they obviously went extremely well, we hope to expand the number of people we reach by doing this on a more server-wide basis!<br>
            We look forward to seeing a lot of you! Tell all your friends and guildmates!<br>
            Any questions or concerns you have can be directed to either myself (email me at melodydoll@alloymail.com) or the Guildmaster, Rasplorien Aegerius at Rasplorien@hotmail.com! <br>
            You can also check out our website at http://twistedshard.tripod.com/index.html for more infomation about the lotto and what we are about in general!<br>
          May Tunare bless thee and fare thee well,<br>
          ~Quella Junipurr<br>
          Master Brewer and ever-loyal druid of the Wildfyre Legion<br>
